    question: "Explain MQA (Multi-Query Attention) and GQA (Grouped Query Attention).",
    answer:
`TODO — key points:
• MHA baseline: h query heads, h key heads, h value heads
• MQA (Shazeer 2019): 1 K head and 1 V head shared across all h Q heads → KV cache h× smaller; faster inference; slight quality loss
• GQA (Ainslie et al. 2023): G groups of Q heads share one K/V head; interpolates between MHA (G=h) and MQA (G=1)
• Used in: Llama 2 (GQA for 70B), Llama 3 (all sizes), Mistral, Gemma`
  },

  {
    id: "opt-1",
